Author: AzaharPing contributors

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatibles with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: AzaharPing

Summary: Latency to the other players of a local match

Description: |
  Shows, on the top screen, the latency to the other
  players of a local-wireless match, read from the game's
  own packets (Pia and PRUDP v1). No setup, nothing needed
  on the other consoles. Runs only inside Azahar.

Compatibility: Citra

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
